  "prohibitedInferences": [
    "Do not apply hotel-star semantics to a non-hotel type without a named compatible scheme.",
    "Do not treat the existence of a kitchen, pool, locker, hookup or bathroom as proof that it is private, usable, included, open or fit.",
    "Do not compare an entire unit, a private room, a dorm bed and a pitch as interchangeable inventory.",
    "Do not convert missing type-specific evidence into a quality penalty or a favorable assumption."
  ]
}
